Depends: libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.10), libgtk4-layer-shell0, libglib2.0-0, curl, ca-certificates, xdg-utils, wl-clipboard
Recommends: libsecret-tools, fonts-noto-color-emoji
Description: desktop widgets and search for Linux
 Deck is a set of always-on-desktop widgets plus a Spotlight-style search
 panel. This package provides the GTK4 shell, the system/network widgets,
 CalBox, ClipBox, LogBox, MetricBox and the background sampler.
 .
 It works as a layer-shell desktop surface on labwc, KDE Plasma and wlroots,
 and as a normal borderless window on GNOME and X11 until the L7 backends are
 available.
